        <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/refuah">
          <tei:div>
            <tei:p><tei:pb n="88" ed="1949 chol/shacharit/amidah" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n112_medium.jpg"/>Heal us, O Lord, and we shall be healed; save us and we shall be saved; for thou art our praise. Grant a perfect healing to all our wounds; for thou art a faithful and merciful God, King and Healer. Blessed art thou, O Lord, who healest the sick among thy people Israel.</tei:p>
